1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Welcome learners and introduce the objective.

2
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Eligibility workers must explain which household changes must be reported and the applicable reporting deadline.

3
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:24,000
When electronic data is incomplete, eligibility workers should request acceptable proof and explain available options clearly.

4
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Program-specific reporting requirements must be explicit, without combining different deadlines into a universal rule.

5
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Eligibility workers need to confirm reported changes, identify the affected program, request necessary evidence, document the action taken, and inform the household of the next steps.

6
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:48,000
Eligibility workers must thoroughly document all aspects of a reported change to ensure compliance and accurate record-keeping.
